          <span class="live">Live in production</span>
        </div>
        <h1>TM Go</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">A tour-management agent for independent bands. It advances shows over email and SMS, reads free-form venue replies, pulls out the logistics, and keeps each tour's records in sync. This write-up covers the system, the <strong>seven engineering decisions</strong> that made it safe to write to a band's real data, and where it goes next.</p>
